She ruined it.

260
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:36,980
If she just got married as I said, do you
have any clue how powerful I would be?

261
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:40,797
I'd have conquered them
all Kaido and Whitebeard

262
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:43,704
and red-haired Jinx would
have fallen before me.

263
00:15:43,860 --> 00:15:49,220
If it wasn't for her I'd
already be king of the pirates

264
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:05,320
Cat burglar Nami, you're
gonna help me kill Lola.

265
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:10,780
You'll tell me where she is,
or I'll beat it out of you.

266
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:17,340
You're making stupid excuses, Big Mom.

267
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:24,200
Lola didn't get married,
and that's on her.

268
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:29,997
You haven't become king of the pirates,

269
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:34,940
and that's on you; nothing else to it.

270
00:16:38,760 --> 00:16:41,320
Get over here and fight me!

271
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:45,797
I'm not backing down, even
if you are an emperor!

272
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:48,697
I'm taking Sanji back no matter what;

273
00:16:48,780 --> 00:16:52,200
I'm gonna turn this all
around and make you sorry!

274
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:13,240
What is going on out there?

275
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:17,910
Click.

276
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:19,740
Baron Tamago! Help!

277
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:20,979
It's the intruder!

278
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:23,497
The tiger mink's totally
wrecking up the place!

279
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:25,660
Don't you mean jaguar mink?

280
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:32,220
Pedro, so you've already
infiltré le Shit? Calic. Hold on!

281
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,694
I'm not done with you!

282
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:37,017
He sure is funny, huh?

283
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:40,437
How do you think that would go?

284
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:43,777
You've got no bargaining chips
and you're deep in mama's Shit.

285
00:17:43,860 --> 00:17:45,917
Come on, let me out.

286
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,857
Fight me if you're so tough.

287
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:51,140
What now?

288
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,177
What's up, fam?

289
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:00,777
Coming through, coming through.

290
00:18:00,860 --> 00:18:04,600
Hey, unglaze, what's going on?

291
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:10,057
We got trouble at the treasure room.

292
00:18:10,140 --> 00:18:15,057
We got an intruding coming
through an intruder.

293
00:18:15,140 --> 00:18:20,057
You must mean, yeah, that I did my
job, but I ain't brushing my teeth.

294
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,860
No way, not today.

295
00:18:29,780 --> 00:18:33,120
Everyone, please get out
of here while you can.

296
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:37,660
Don't let him get away!

297
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:51,020
Hurry up!

298
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:53,960
He's made fools of us enough already!

299
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:57,052
I think he moved you the other whole way!

300
00:18:58,580 --> 00:18:59,757
Guess it's time.

301
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:03,620
Soul King coming to you live
from the Whole Cake Shit.

302
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:10,980
Ladies and gentlemen,
let's get ready to rock!

303
00:19:15,980 --> 00:19:18,240
You're not mad, Mama? Really?

304
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,060
Because of that squirt?

305
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:24,376
Why do I care if he wants to bite me?

306
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:26,800
Why be angry, Zeus?

307
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:29,600
There's so much to look forward to!

308
00:19:33,980 --> 00:19:35,920
Now it's in my sight.

309
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:38,180
Finally I'll have germ as mine.

310
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:42,100
And then the tomate box
will be good and mine.

311
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:47,000
Don't forget the cake.

312
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:51,140
I deserve only the finest cake there is.

313
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,960
Don't you think?

314
00:19:53,740 --> 00:19:54,920
Don't you think?

315
00:19:56,220 --> 00:19:59,560
When I just think of tomorrow.

316
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:05,057
It washes away all my sorrows.

317
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:09,537
With a plan this good, there's
no way that I'd be back.

318
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:14,077
A joyous day, I'm on my way.

319
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:16,380
Happy day.

320
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:22,257
I'm getting a signal.

321
00:20:22,340 --> 00:20:26,700
Hey, there's an intruder
near the repository.

322
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:28,820
The treasure room?

323
00:20:29,060 --> 00:20:31,280
Time for the wedding cake.

324
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:33,160
Only the finest.

325
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:36,320
Time for the wedding cake.

326
00:20:41,360 --> 00:20:45,620
I bet the rotten bastard is
trying to nab my tomate box.

327
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:48,180
Who is it, huh?

328
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:51,320
It's fine.

329
00:20:51,860 --> 00:20:52,919
It's fine, dammit.

330
00:20:53,580 --> 00:20:55,217
Luffy and the others won't be hurt.

331
00:20:55,300 --> 00:20:56,771
Big Mom promised me that.

332
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:59,700
If I get married, the
Baratie will be fine too.

333
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:03,457
Of course I don't want
to leave my friends.

334
00:21:03,540 --> 00:21:04,937
But at least no one will die.

335
00:21:05,020 --> 00:21:06,432
That's all that matters.

336
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:09,780
Why can't I be grateful?

337
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,580
Pudding is all I've got.

338
00:21:12,880 --> 00:21:14,280
I can't make her sad.

339
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:16,206
Gotta put on a smile for her.

340
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:22,360
If you decide to marry
me, I won't let it be hell

341
00:21:26,220 --> 00:21:28,660
Who could hurt a sweet girl like that?

342
00:21:28,840 --> 00:21:30,958
I'd have to be some kind of monster.

343
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:35,737
I'll make you happy,
Press, don't you worry.

344
00:21:35,820 --> 00:21:37,477
Just regular Sanji.

345
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:41,000
You know me, the romantic chef, right?

346
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:44,210
Morning!

347
00:21:44,293 --> 00:21:46,280
My sweet bride!

348
00:21:46,680 --> 00:21:48,120
I won't let you down!

349
00:21:48,420 --> 00:21:50,120
I'll shower you with love!

350
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:55,480
Lola? Really? Indeed.

351
00:21:55,980 --> 00:21:59,000
Seems the Straw Hat Girl
got a Vivre card from her,

352
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:01,637
so the homies in the
forest couldn't fight back.

353
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:03,426
She had them working for her.

354
00:22:04,060 --> 00:22:04,980
By the way,

355
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:06,677
I hate to break this to you,

356
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:10,348
but Mama rejected the wedding
dress you picked out yesterday.

357
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:13,833
She'll expect you to wear the
one she picked out instead.

358
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:17,257
Mama planned out everything
after the wedding as well.

359
00:22:17,340 --> 00:22:18,987
I'll show you the itinerary.

360
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:25,249
Lady Pudding, it's
still raining out there.

361
00:22:26,160 --> 00:22:27,540
What's on her mind?

362
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:37,080
Pudding, as long as you do what you're
told, everything will work out just fine.

363
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:42,200
Think of yourself as my little doll,
because that's all you are, Pudding.

364
00:22:42,820 --> 00:22:45,120
Be a good girl. Okay.

365
00:23:00,260 --> 00:23:02,620
Don't worry, Mama would never kill me.

366
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:04,680
We're family, aren't we?

367
00:23:05,160 --> 00:23:07,101
But I want to choose who I marry.

368
00:23:07,320 --> 00:23:08,849
You'll understand someday.

369
00:23:25,300 --> 00:23:29,712
How could they let something like this
happen the day before the tea party?

370
00:23:36,940 --> 00:23:39,080
That's him! Get ready!

371
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:48,020
He's fast!

372
00:24:00,440 --> 00:24:03,080
You're going down on whoever you are!

373
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,560
YAAAAAAAH! Huh!

374
00:24:15,740 --> 00:24:17,000
Shoot him!

375
00:24:24,860 --> 00:24:26,040
Fire! Hurry!

376
00:24:33,980 --> 00:24:34,860
Run away!

377
00:24:51,820 --> 00:24:53,260
So where is he now?

378
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,598
He went downstairs.

379
00:24:54,820 --> 00:24:58,057
He's on the third floor of the Red
Bean Bomb Cake, near the courtyard.

380
00:24:58,140 --> 00:25:00,597
He's a slippery little
miscreant, isn't he?

381
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:04,020
Try to go to him as a guy
that's evil play. Roger.

382
00:25:09,140 --> 00:25:13,360
I think that's enough guards
for me for a whole lifetime.

383
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:17,640
You finally decided to face us, did you?

384
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:24,889
Well, all things considered, I
suppose I shouldn't complain.

385
00:25:25,320 --> 00:25:27,117
They'd all thinned him out considerably.

386
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:32,517
huh I've never seen a creature like
you we got all sorts of things here in

387
00:25:32,600 --> 00:25:35,277
this country but you are one-of-a-kind

388
00:25:35,360 --> 00:25:41,020
oh I agree can't wait to show you to mama

389
00:26:08,740 --> 00:26:10,740
C 'est bon, General, c 'est bon!

390
00:26:11,020 --> 00:26:13,497
There's only one entrance
to the room, after all.

391
00:26:13,580 --> 00:26:17,257
And if he doesn't manage to steal that
dresser, he won't be able to escape you.

392
00:26:17,340 --> 00:26:18,840
Et l 'ençon sera sans ça!

393
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:22,957
As long as you guard that dark loosely,
everything should be too charmant.

394
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:25,260
Sounds simple enough. Count on me.

395
00:26:25,900 --> 00:26:28,076
But let's assume he beats the guards.

396
00:26:28,260 --> 00:26:32,700
When he comes out and tries to
escape, should I kill him? No, no!

397
00:26:32,980 --> 00:26:35,039
The man in question is un skeleton.

398
00:26:35,520 --> 00:26:37,420
Mama will want him, be sure.

399
00:26:38,560 --> 00:26:40,500
Beat him, but don't kill him.

400
00:26:41,020 --> 00:26:42,280
No problem.

401
00:26:54,020 --> 00:26:57,180
Pedro told me all about you.

402
00:26:57,880 --> 00:27:02,056
You're infused with human souls
courtesy of Big Mom's remarkable power.

403
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:06,600
That means I know what
makes you soldiers tick.

404
00:27:09,780 --> 00:27:12,760
And it's the power of soul, baby!

405
00:27:17,900 --> 00:27:20,540
You're not powerful, aren't you?

406
00:27:21,220 --> 00:27:22,620
You're too big at all!

407
00:27:23,360 --> 00:27:25,220
We've got him on the run!

408
00:27:25,460 --> 00:27:26,640
Take him out!

409
00:27:33,300 --> 00:27:34,700
No way to run!

410
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:36,200
You're done for!

411
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:39,900
Let's not be cruel.

412
00:27:40,180 --> 00:27:41,400
Just wait.

413
00:27:41,680 --> 00:27:42,640
It'll be good.

414
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:48,740
Gentlemen, please wait!

415
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:12,630
Huh?

416
00:28:12,713 --> 00:28:13,797
What the hell was that?

417
00:28:13,880 --> 00:28:18,260
Do you happen to know what
my stage name is, baby?

418
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:47,900
What you got, it ain't real, Snow.

419
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:54,540
It runs away, scared, that
sloppy, slapped-on, spirity horse.

420
00:28:54,880 --> 00:29:00,960
When you hear my soul scream, it
knocks you off your feet, baby.

421
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:15,060
How long are you going to keep this up?

422
00:29:24,360 --> 00:29:25,190
Oh!

423
00:29:25,273 --> 00:29:26,240
Fancy seeing you here!

424
00:29:27,220 --> 00:29:28,926
What's the occasion, Pudding?

425
00:29:31,500 --> 00:29:32,330
Pudding?

426
00:29:36,520 --> 00:29:37,880
Good! It's you!

427
00:29:38,080 --> 00:29:39,257
Now get us out of here!

428
00:29:39,340 --> 00:29:40,170
Luffy, stop!

429
00:29:40,253 --> 00:29:41,597
This guy is making me mad!

430
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,517
You can't talk with the enemy right here!

431
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:45,477
You're being very quiet, Pudding.

432
00:29:45,560 --> 00:29:46,442
Can I help you?

433
00:29:49,080 --> 00:29:50,540
Could you open the book?

434
00:29:51,020 --> 00:29:55,020
I just needed to say something to
Luffy and Nami before the wedding.

435
00:29:56,040 --> 00:29:58,917
I don't really get it, but okay.

436
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,529
Whatever floats your boat.

437
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:05,800
Alright, I'll put in a bookmark.

438
00:30:16,540 --> 00:30:17,370
Pudding.

439
00:30:19,120 --> 00:30:20,800
This has gone all wrong!

440
00:30:22,460 --> 00:30:24,160
Hey, what gives?

441
00:30:24,400 --> 00:30:26,177
We went to the coast, like you said.

442
00:30:26,260 --> 00:30:27,377
Cut it out!

443
00:30:27,460 --> 00:30:29,754
You're gonna get him in trouble, dummy!

444
00:30:33,500 --> 00:30:34,900
You're all beaten up.

445
00:30:36,280 --> 00:30:37,110
Muffy.

446
00:30:37,960 --> 00:30:38,790
Nami.

447
00:30:41,040 --> 00:30:42,717
My brothers and sisters.

448
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:45,380
They've done terrible things to you.

449
00:30:47,100 --> 00:30:48,600
I'm so sorry.

450
00:30:50,100 --> 00:30:51,460
No, it's...

451
00:30:52,720 --> 00:30:55,857
I'm sorry I couldn't make it
to the coast like I promised.

452
00:30:55,940 --> 00:30:57,557
This is all my fault.

453
00:30:57,640 --> 00:30:59,197
We don't blame you!

454
00:30:59,280 --> 00:31:01,560
Just pick up your head, okay?

455
00:31:03,900 --> 00:31:05,760
What are they whispering about?

456
00:31:06,020 --> 00:31:07,140
I can't hear them.

457
00:31:09,380 --> 00:31:10,740
Truth is...

458
00:31:13,280 --> 00:31:17,560
I met with Sanji, and he proposed to me.

459
00:31:53,700 --> 00:31:55,520
He made me so happy.

460
00:31:56,900 --> 00:31:57,880
But still.

461
00:31:58,880 --> 00:32:01,637
I know Sanji only said
that to be nice to me.

462
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:03,485
It's not what he really wants.

463
00:32:04,900 --> 00:32:05,997
The truth is.

464
00:32:06,080 --> 00:32:07,657
I'm just causing everyone trouble.

465
00:32:07,740 --> 00:32:09,140
Now don't say that!

466
00:32:11,940 --> 00:32:14,040
But you don't have to worry.

467
00:32:16,640 --> 00:32:17,560
I'm not

468
00:32:18,460 --> 00:32:19,940
going to marry him.

469
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:28,560
Listen.

470
00:32:55,520 --> 00:32:56,940
Hey, Pudding, wait!

471
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:09,080
Well, goodbye.
